# Java Deep Copy Utility

A reflection-based deep copy implementation for Java 21+ that handles arbitrary object graphs, collections, arrays, and circular references without relying on `Serializable` or `Cloneable`.

## Features
*   Correctly copies complex nested objects.
*   Handles cyclic references using `IdentityHashMap`.
*   Supports arrays (including primitive arrays), `List`, `Set`, and `Map`.
*   Uses only standard J2SE library.

## Usage

```java
Man original = new Man("John", 30, List.of("Book1"));
Man copy = CopyUtils.deepCopy(original);
